dropped
  java    Context's environment constants and the naming framework's own classes (Name, NameParser, NamingEnumeration's other uses, Referenceable): JNDI's plumbing over every naming service
  dotnet  DirectoryRequest, DirectoryResponse's base classes, DirectoryOperation, DsmlAuthRequest (DSML over SOAP), LdapSessionOptions.LocatorFlag, LocatorFlags, LdapSessionOptions.PingKeepAliveTimeout, LdapSessionOptions.PingLimit, LdapSessionOptions.PingWaitTimeout, LdapSessionOptions.TcpKeepAlive, LdapSessionOptions.HostReachable, LdapSessionOptions.QueryClientCertificate, QueryClientCertificateCallback, LdapSessionOptions.VerifyServerCertificate, VerifyServerCertificateCallback, LdapSessionOptions.SslInformation, SecurityPackageContextConnectionInformation, SecurityProtocol: Windows's locator, keep-alives and SChannel's own settings, which `tls` decides
  go      Logger, DebugBinaryFile, Client (an interface), Conn.Start, Response (an interface), Error.Error, Error.Unwrap, every control's Encode, GetControlType and String: plumbing of Go's types
  python  Connection.usage, Connection.repr_with_sensitive_data_stripped, Connection.response_to_json, Connection.response_to_file, Connection.refresh_server_info, Server.check_availability, Server.reset_availability, Server.update_availability, Server.candidate_addresses, Server.address_info, Server.next_message_id, Server.from_definition, Server.attach_dsa_info, get_config_parameter, set_config_parameter, MOCK_SYNC, MOCK_ASYNC, IP_V4_ONLY, IP_V6_ONLY, IP_V4_PREFERRED, IP_V6_PREFERRED, IP_SYSTEM_DEFAULT, utils.conv.to_unicode, utils.conv.to_raw, utils.conv.format_json, utils.conv.json_hook, utils.conv.json_encode_b64, utils.conv.check_json_dict, utils.conv.prepare_for_stream, utils.conv.b64encode, utils.conv.b64decode, utils.conv.CaseInsensitiveDict: statistics, mock strategies, address families, JSON rendering and conversions of Python's own types
